WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:01.720
Sabes, podría

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:03.160
have a role for you.

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:08.760
Really?

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:10.560
For me?

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:13.200
What role?

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:15.120
It's more interesting than

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:16.560
anything you've played so far.

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:17.120
So...

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:18.320
Thank you so much.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:19.800
Thanks.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:22.000
Suit up and meet

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:22.880
me at the hospital.

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:24.040
Bye.

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:27.680
Hey wait, Gina.

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:32.400
Hi.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:33.880
Hey.

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:40.400
What do you want?

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:42.120
I want to apologize.

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:46.960
I love you, Gina,

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:49.160
and I want to make things right.

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:53.280
Did Daddy update

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:55.320
the inheritance conditions?

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:57.680
Look, I hesitated

00:00:57.680 --> 00:00:58.960
back there at the table

00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:00.280
but it wasn't because I was

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:02.320
afraid of going against my father.

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:06.720
I realized it didn't matter

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:09.200
if you were pregnant or not.

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:13.560
I want to be with you.

00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:21.400
What about that chairman's seat?

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:23.760
If you're not by my side,

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:25.640
it means nothing to me.
